Z||000000||1FST2M6||03-17-2000||03:28 PM||||Ladies and Gentleman I present to you the newest member of the Intimate with their Fiero Club. Todd or as you might know him BlackGT. He has taken this great leap and decided to do his own clutch job with your support and a couple hours worth of my assistance hes back on the road picking fights with Moostangs!  Congrats Todd!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   He's installed a 4 puck unsprung ACT (just like mine) and new pressure plate. MUCH to his amazment. IT WORKS!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Now on to the NITROUS.. ready Todd... ||||reg||1
Z||000001||GT Bastard||03-17-2000||03:37 PM||||Awesome... I've been dying to know what happened.  What are the advantages of that clutch, and how much does it cost?||||reg||1
